# {app_name}

A group of Lumis language packages for {languages_text}.

## Installation

```elixir
def deps do
  [
    {:lumis, "~> {lumis_requirement}"},
    {:{app_name}, "~> {hex_requirement}"}
  ]
end
```

## What it contains

Nothing but the list above. This package has no code and no parser bytes — it
depends on one `lumis_wasm_*` package per language, and each of those carries a
Tree-sitter WASM parser and its queries. Adding it adds them all, and it widens
when the bundle gains a language.

Depend on the individual packages instead if you want to choose them yourself.

